[36m(TaskRunner pid=3347742)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3347742)[0m Given:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3347742)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3347742)[0m \overrightarrow{OA} = \begin{pmatrix} 1 \\ 2 \\ 3 \end{pmatrix}, \quad \overrightarrow{OB} = \begin{pmatrix} -3 \\ -2 \\ 1 \end{pmatrix}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3347742)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3347742)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3347742)[0m The cross product \(\overrightarrow{OA} \times \overrightarrow{OB}\) is calculated as follows:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3347742)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3347742)[0m \overrightarrow{OA} \times \overrightarrow{OB} = \begin{vmatrix}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3347742)[0m \mathbf{i} & \mathbf{j} & \mathbf{k} \\
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3347742)[0m 1 & 2 & 3 \\
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3347742)[0m -3 & -2 & 1
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3347742)[0m \end{vmatrix}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3347742)[0m = \mathbf{i}(2 \cdot 1 - 3 \cdot (-2)) - \mathbf{j}(1 \cdot 1 - 3 \cdot (-3)) + \mathbf{k}(1 \cdot (-2) - 2 \cdot (-3))
