[36m(TaskRunner pid=3347742)[0m = \begin{pmatrix} 8 \\ -10 \\ 4 \end{pmatrix}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3347742)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3347742)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3347742)[0m The magnitude of this vector is:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3347742)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3347742)[0m \|\overrightarrow{OA} \times \overrightarrow{OB}\| = \sqrt{8^2 + (-10)^2 + 4^2} = \sqrt{64 + 100 + 16} = \sqrt{180} = 6\sqrt{5}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3347742)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3347742)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3347742)[0m So, the area of the triangle \(OAB\) is half of this magnitude:
