[36m(TaskRunner pid=3347742)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3347742)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3347742)[0m We can solve these equations to find \( s \) and \( t \).
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3347742)[0m 
