[36m(TaskRunner pid=3347742)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3347742)[0m 2. Rotate \( z' \) by \( \frac{\pi}{4} \):
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3347742)[0m \[ z'' = z' \cdot e^{i \frac{\pi}{4}} = (\sqrt{2} - 3\sqrt{2}i) \cdot \frac{1+i}{\sqrt{2}} = (\sqrt{2} - 3\sqrt{2}i) \cdot \frac{1+i}{\sqrt{2}} = (1 - 3i)(1+i) = 1 + i - 3i - 3i^2 = 1 - 2i + 3 = 4 - 2i. \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3347742)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3347742)[0m 3. Translate back by adding \( c \):
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3347742)[0m \[ w = z'' + c = (4 - 2i) + (2 - 3i) = 4 + 2 - 2i - 3i = 6 - 5i. \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3347742)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3347742)[0m So the final answer is:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3347742)[0m \[ \boxed{6 - 5i}. \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3347742)[0m 
