[36m(TaskRunner pid=3347742)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3347742)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3347742)[0m For the second scenario:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3347742)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3347742)[0m \text{Time spent walking} = 2.4 \text{ hours} - \frac{t}{60} \text{ hours} = \frac{9}{s+2} \text{ hours}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3347742)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3347742)[0m So,
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3347742)[0m \[
