[36m(TaskRunner pid=3347742)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3347742)[0m Multiplying both sides by 60 gives:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3347742)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3347742)[0m 144 - t = \frac{540}{s+2} \quad \text{(Equation 2)}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3347742)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3347742)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3347742)[0m Now we have two equations:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3347742)[0m 1. \(240 - t = \frac{540}{s}\)
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3347742)[0m 2. \(144 - t = \frac{540}{s+2}\)
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3347742)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3347742)[0m We can solve these equations simultaneously to find \(s\) and \(t\).
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3347742)[0m 
