[36m(TaskRunner pid=3347742)[0m \end{aligned}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3347742)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3347742)[0m The gcd of \(997\) and \(1000\) is \(1\), so the inverse exists. Now we use the Extended Euclidean Algorithm to find the coefficients.
