[36m(TaskRunner pid=3347742)[0m \[997x - 1000k = 1\]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3347742)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3347742)[0m We can solve this using the Extended Euclidean Algorithm. Let's implement this in Python.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3347742)[0m ```python
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3347742)[0m def extended_gcd(a, b):
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3347742)[0m     if a == 0:
